{"_v":1,"id":"the-book-of-mormon-west-end-2024","bd":{"positive":6,"mixed":0,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Allis Brennan","o":"Evening Standard","s":95,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/go/london/theatre/the-book-of-mormon-musical-theatre-tickets-in-london-a3706421.html","d":"2017-11-20","q":"If you believe in a perfect musical, this might just be it."},{"cn":"JeanPierre 4251","o":"The Times (UK)","s":91,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.show-score.com/uk/london/west-end-shows/the-book-of-mormon-london","q":"A night of unalloyed joy. And damned fine music."},{"cn":"Euan Ferguson","o":"The Guardian","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2013/mar/24/book-of-mormon-review","d":"2013-03-24","q":"The Book of Mormon is far, far cleverer, far kinder, far more nuanced than that, and one of its many surprises is that it sent an enraptured, ecstatic audience home with an odd sense of having come, somehow, to really like Mormons."},{"cn":"Libby Purves","o":"The Times (UK)","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/the-book-of-mormon-prince-of-wales-w1-28gmrq88q5l","d":"2013-03-22","q":"It offers big belting numbers, witty lyrics, and joyfully athletic dances."},{"cn":"Theo Bosanquet","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://musicaltheatrereview.com/the-book-of-mormon-big-winner-whatsonstage-awards/","d":"2013-03-21","q":"But for me and my generation, reared on South Park and Team America, there is little here to genuinely shock, and laughs by the bucketload."},{"cn":"Paul Taylor","o":"The Independent","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/theatre-review-the-book-of-mormon-merely-flirts-with-blasphemy-but-there-is-something-very-winning-8543751.html","d":"2013-03-21","q":"Directed with terrific zap and zestful precision."},{"cn":"Ian Shuttleworth","o":"Financial Times","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/e0a3d0e6-92d9-11e2-b3be-00144feabdc0","d":"2013-03-24","q":"The show works at root as a feel good evening."}],"au":{"score":86,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":86,"c":3699,"sr":4.3}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/2cjrziCaxvj1NXO3vdiNv0/e0339325959730a8f42ce47ef2be27f1/The_Book_of_Mormon_-_Hero?fm=webp&q=90"}